<title>USA: Continental Homes restarts shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Continental Homes restarts shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Homes Holding Corp said Friday it has reinstituted a 500,000 share common stock repurchase plan that had previously been approved by the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>&quot;The board believes that the company's stock is undervalued and that the reinstitution of the stock repurchase program is warranted at this time,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
